# Large File Types & Data
*.pdf
*.zip
*.7z
*.gz
# ...except the archive fixity manifests. `*.gz` exists to keep GNSS data out
# of the repo; these are checksums OF that data, and the whole point of a
# fingerprint is that it lives somewhere other than the disk it describes.
!docs/archive-manifests/*.gz
*.rar
*.exe
*.mp4
*.nc
*.grad
*.kin
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.gmt
*.cpt

# Ignore asset folders from saved HTML pages
*_files/

# Specific large files/dirs to ignore if they sneak past extensions
analysis/06 Ku-en Dislocation Model/04 GMT/PH_topo.grad
analysis/06 Ku-en Dislocation Model/04 GMT/PH_topo.nc
analysis/08 Bootstrapping/boostrap.mp4

# Exemption for critical documentation PDFs (if any)
# You can uncomment and specify paths to PDFs that MUST be in the repo.
# !docs/bern52/BERN52_Guide.pdf

*.env

# Deployment scripts containing credentials — never commit
scripts/bern_install.md
scripts/deploy_r740.sh
scripts/deploy_r740_checklist.md
scripts/deploy_r740.secrets
*.secrets

# git worktrees (multi-instance dev)
.trees/

# sudo run-script output — the scripts are committed, their logs are not
scripts/sudo/logs/

# Field account credential lists (INITIALS,surname). Both halves of every
# login live here — never commit. See scripts/seed_field_accounts.py.
*surnames*.csv
*surnames*.txt

# Generated field passwords (INITIALS<TAB>password). Written by
# scripts/seed_field_accounts.py --slips, printed, then shredded.
*credentials*.txt
*credentials*.csv

# Credential notes — never commit (repo is public)
docs/secrets.md

# Assembled deployment env for pasting into a dashboard. Contains every
# secret in one file; delete it once the values are set.
*render-env*.txt

# Working area for drafts and staged Bernese config. Untracked by convention,
# ignored explicitly because the repository is PUBLIC and this directory holds
# unsent correspondence naming real officials, plus staged campaign config.
# One `git add .` was the only thing standing between that and a public commit.
temp/
